#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/routelists/help.js:42
msgid ""
"Comments (# ...) in list files are not documented by ZeroBlock. Its auto-"
"detection is binary: a line with \"/\" or consisting of digits and dots is "
"treated as IP/CIDR, everything else — including a comment line — silently "
"becomes a \"domain\". That is why comments produce a warning here, and why "
"invalid lines are worth fixing: ZeroBlock will never report them."
msgstr ""

